      ],
      "rdfs:label": "Has Definition Node",
      "rdfs:comment": "Links a canonical estleg:Concept node to every provision-local definition node (estleg:LegalConcept) that defines that term. Inverse of estleg:definesConcept. Introduced (#134, Finding F3) as a property distinct from estleg:definedIn so the latter's owl:inverseOf estleg:definesTerm axiom does not falsely conclude that a LegalConcept estleg:definesTerm a Concept.",
